
Sheet 3: viscosity
    central shear rate dvx/dz = +0.3533  (R^2=1.000)
    mean shear stress pxz = -0.3467
    viscosity eta = |pxz| / (dvx/dz) ~ 0.981
    (single-run values vary with the seed and the run length.)
    fluid temperature T(z): walls ~2.17 / 2.17, centre ~3.21
    (flat under gentle shear; a hot-centre hump means viscous heating ->
     the channel is no longer isothermal, so a single eta no longer describes it.)
    plot -> day1_viscosity.png
